  <!-- EN: obsidia caterpillar -->
  <OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.label>黑曜石毛虫</OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.label>
  <!-- EN: Caterpillar is a genetically engineered creature. Scientists planned to create a small, peaceful creature that would serve as a convenient source of meat.\n\nThis specimen adapted to life at cold temperatures. -->
  <OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.description>毛虫是一种基因工程生物。科学家计划创造一种小型、温顺的生物，作为方便的肉食来源。\n\n这个样本适应了寒冷温度下的生活。</OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.description>
  <!-- EN: mandibles -->
  <OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.tools.mandibles.label>颚</OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.tools.mandibles.label>
  <!-- EN: head -->
  <OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.tools.head.label>头部</OE_Caterpillar_Arctic.tools.head.label>
  
